---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { COOKBOOK_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    <strong>Applied GenAI</strong> is a collection of practical, opinionated recipes for
    building real things with generative AI. Less hype, more patterns that hold up in
    production: agent harnesses, spec-driven development, memory systems, and prompts that
    don't fall over the moment they meet a real user.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every recipe is meant to be runnable. Where there's code, it lives in the companion
    cookbook: <a href={COOKBOOK_URL}>applied-genai-cookbook</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Who writes this</h2>
  <p>
    Written by Mohit Mittal. <em>(Edit <code>src/pages/about.astro</code> to tell your
    story — who you are, what you build, and how to reach you.)</em>
  </p>
</Base>
